OL,3,GNEWSALatest bid to redevelop former pub
OL,4,Arejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a pub which closed in 2016
OL,7,Fhas once again been refused permission
OL,8,Fto change its use.
OL,10,FTelford and Wrekin Council said the
OL,11,Flatest proposal, to turn the Cleveland
OL,12,FArms in High Ercall into a house, would
OL,13,Fhave been an "unjustified permanent
OL,14,Floss of a valued community asset".
OL,16,FOwner John Hickinbottom had argued he
OL,17,Fhad tried to sell it as a pub, and that
OL,18,Fthe costs of refurbishing the building
OL,19,Fwere prohibitive.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
